        "scope": "in_scope",
        "statement": "If $p$ is prime and $\\varnothing\\ne S\\subsetneq\\Z/p\\Z$, then a neighborhood\nof $F_{S,p}$ in a fixed dephased slice of partial Hadamard matrices is a\nreal-analytic manifold of dimension\n\\begin{equation}\nD(m,p)=(m-1)(p-m-1).\n\\end{equation}\nConsequently, $F_{S,p}$ is non-isolated if $2\\leq m\\leq p-2$, and is\nisolated if $m=1$ or $m=p-1$.",
        "status": "preparing",
